   Anfaara, Florence Wullo; Lawson, Erica S., Western Univ, Dept Gender Sexual \& Womens Studies, London, ON, Canada.
   Atuoye, Kilian Nasung, Queens Univ, Dept Global Dev Studies, Kingston, ON, Canada.
